{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52049","headline":"题酒店楼壁绝句八首 三 · 王绩","name":"题酒店楼壁绝句八首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仲任书卷尽，平君（韩理洲疑爲「君平」之倒文，即严君平）不（韩校改爲「卜」）数充。\n相逢何以慰？\n细酌对春风。\n（按：《全唐诗》卷三七收入其一、其二、其三、其六、其七等五首，题作《过酒家五首》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}